<title>USA: IMC Global names Robert Fowler CEO.</title>
<headline>IMC Global names Robert Fowler CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHBROOK, Ill. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>IMC Global Inc said Tuesday it handed its president, Robert Fowler Jr, the additional title of chief executive officer.</p>
<p>He takes on the position from Wendell Bueche, who remains chairman of the board.</p>
<p>IMC Global makes and sells phosphate and potash crop nutrients and animal feed ingredients.</p>
